 "notes": "Comes in gatefold sleeve with liner notes and photographs inside. Contains download code for the free MP3 download of the record.\r\n\r\nA1 taken from the Philips LP 'El Playero' (6346011), 1970\r\nA2 taken from the Philips LP 'Myriam' (6346024), 1971\r\nA3 taken from the Philips LP 'Traigo Salsa' (634478), 1970\r\nA4 taken from the Philips LP 'Rosendo Martínez Y Su Orquesta' (631839)\r\nA5 taken from the Philips LP 'Pepino En Patacumbia'(843317), 1968\r\nB1 taken from the Philips LP 'Mango Candela' (6346012), 1970\r\nB2 taken from the Polydor LP 'Burucuca' (608633), 1961\r\nB3 taken from the Philips LP 'Tabaquito' (631837), 1964\r\nB4 taken from the Philips LP 'Estamos...En La Pomada...' (6346015), 1970\r\nB5 taken from Discos Curros 7\" 45RPM Single (45-c-071), 1964\r\nB6 taken from the Philips LP 'Picanton' (6346027), 1971\r\nC1 taken from the Philips LP 'El Gran Romancito...Y Punto' (634473), 1969\r\nC2 taken from the Philips LP 'Picanton' (6346027), 1971\r\nC3 taken from the Philips LP 'Traigo Salsa' (634478), 1970\r\nC4 taken from the Philips LP 'Salsa Sabrosa' (6377007), Candelazos Curro', 1971\r\nD1 taken from the Philips LP 'Alex Acosta Y Su Orquesta' (631841), 1964\r\nD2 taken from the Philips LP 'Monicongo Prieto' (6346025), 1971\r\nD3 taken from the Philips LP 'Disco De Oro, Bailables Curro No. 8' (631868), 1965\r\nD4 taken from the Philips LP 'Alex Acosta Y Su Orquesta' (631841), 1964\r\nD5 taken from the Philips LP 'El Amor De Leandro' (6346032), 1972\r\n\r\nMastering and vinyl restoration at Sound Mastering, London.\r\nPressed at MPO, Averton.\r\n\r\nTrack D5 is a vinyl bonus track.\r\n\r\nThis compilation ℗&© 2011 Soundway Records Ltd.\r\nManufactured in the EU.\r\n",
